#1 Google Shopping Ads Rank Tracking Platform for Ecommerce — Competitor Monitoring, Market Research & Real-Time Price Tracking

Have you ever searched for a real solution to track your Google Shopping Ads rankings?

We’re launching Robinhood Analytics – the first dedicated Google Shopping Ads tracking platform.
Unlike traditional Google Ads reporting that only shows what happens after someone clicks, Robinhood Analytics reveals your complete Shopping SERP presence and competitive positioning – the data that decides whether customers click your ads in the first place.

Real-time rank tracking (not snapshots);
- Scans Google Shopping every 10 minutes to calculate true daily average position so you’re not misled by a single moment in time;
- Shows the full Top 40 results – you and every competitor.

Total visibility, any way you need it:
- Desktop vs Mobile rankings side by side (they’re often very different);
- Location intelligence: country view down to individual cities;
- Track a single product, your entire catalog, one competitor, or the whole market;
- Company & Product modes: see company-wide averages or exact product positions.

Google Ads + SERP on one screen:
- Overlay rankings with impressions, clicks, ROAS and other Google Ads Metrics;
- Get actionable analytics for your campaigns, search terms and products.

Competitor price monitoring:
- Track prices for the entire market, a brand, or a single SKU;
- Monitor discounts, promo waves, and price volatility to spot price wars early.

Titles & images analytics:
- Track how title/image changes impact rankings over time and analyzes titles against 55 ranking factors.

If you’ve been searching for a serious, purpose-built way to track your Google Shopping Ads and see the full competitive picture – this is it.
